OL,3,GNEWSADoctors criticise police delay
OL,4,Aover racist attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour doctors who say they were
OL,7,Fsubjected to a racially-motivated
OL,8,Fattack last month have criticised
OL,9,FSussex Police for a slow response.
OL,11,FThe doctors, who work at St Richard's
OL,12,FHospital in Chichester, accused the
OL,13,Fforce of only taking statements almost
OL,14,Fthree weeks later, after they contacted
OL,15,Fthe city's MP Jess Brown-Fuller.
OL,17,FTwo of the doctors, who have chosen to
OL,18,Fremain anonymous, told the BBC the the
OL,19,Fassault began with "racial slurs"
OL,20,Fbefore descending into "punching" and
OL,21,F"kicking".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
