OL,3,GNEWSADoctors criticise police delay
OL,4,Aover racist attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FSussex Police said its response "did
OL,7,Fnot reflect the service we aim to
OL,8,Fprovide" and that the incident was
OL,9,Fbeing treated as a hate crime.
